@startuml MyBatis-初始化相关类图
title MyBatis 初始化相关类图（启动与工厂装配）

top to bottom direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "启动入口" {
  interface SqlSessionFactory

  class SqlSessionFactoryBuilder {
    +build(reader: Reader, environment: String, properties: Properties): SqlSessionFactory
    +build(inputStream: InputStream, environment: String, properties: Properties): SqlSessionFactory
    +build(config: Configuration): SqlSessionFactory
  }

  class DefaultSqlSessionFactory {
    -configuration: Configuration
    +openSession(): SqlSession
    +getConfiguration(): Configuration
  }
}

package "配置构建" {
  abstract class BaseBuilder {
    #configuration: Configuration
  }

  class XMLConfigBuilder {
    -parsed: boolean
    -parser: XPathParser
    -environment: String
    +parse(): Configuration
    -parseConfiguration(root: XNode)
  }

  class Configuration {
    -variables: Properties
    -environment: Environment
    -loadedResources: Set
    +setVariables(props: Properties)
    +setEnvironment(environment: Environment)
    +addLoadedResource(resource: String)
    +addMappers(packageName: String)
    +addMapper(type: Class)
  }

  class XPathParser {
    -document: Document
    -variables: Properties
    +evalNode(expression: String): XNode
    +evalNodes(expression: String): List
  }

  class XNode {
    +evalNode(path: String): XNode
    +evalNodes(path: String): List
    +getStringAttribute(name: String): String
    +getChildrenAsProperties(): Properties
  }

  class XMLMapperEntityResolver
}

package "环境装配" {
  interface TransactionFactory {
    +setProperties(props: Properties)
    +newTransaction(...): Transaction
  }

  interface DataSourceFactory {
    +setProperties(props: Properties)
    +getDataSource(): DataSource
  }

  interface DataSource
  interface Transaction

  class Environment {
    -id: String
    -transactionFactory: TransactionFactory
    -dataSource: DataSource
    +getId(): String
    +getTransactionFactory(): TransactionFactory
    +getDataSource(): DataSource
  }

  class "Environment.Builder" as EnvironmentBuilder {
    -id: String
    +transactionFactory(factory: TransactionFactory): EnvironmentBuilder
    +dataSource(dataSource: DataSource): EnvironmentBuilder
    +build(): Environment
  }
}

SqlSessionFactory <|.. DefaultSqlSessionFactory
SqlSessionFactoryBuilder --> XMLConfigBuilder : create parser
SqlSessionFactoryBuilder ..> DefaultSqlSessionFactory : build(config)

XMLConfigBuilder --|> BaseBuilder
BaseBuilder --> Configuration
XMLConfigBuilder o--> XPathParser
XPathParser ..> XMLMapperEntityResolver : DTD / EntityResolver
XPathParser ..> XNode : evalNode()/evalNodes()
XMLConfigBuilder --> XNode : /configuration
XMLConfigBuilder --> Configuration : settings / aliases / plugins / mappers
XMLConfigBuilder --> TransactionFactory : transactionManagerElement()
XMLConfigBuilder --> DataSourceFactory : dataSourceElement()
XMLConfigBuilder --> EnvironmentBuilder : environmentsElement()
EnvironmentBuilder --> Environment : build()
Environment o--> TransactionFactory
Environment o--> DataSource

DefaultSqlSessionFactory o--> Configuration

note top of SqlSessionFactoryBuilder
  启动主入口：
  build(Reader/InputStream) 会先创建 XMLConfigBuilder，
  再调用 parse() 得到 Configuration，
  最后包装成 DefaultSqlSessionFactory。
end note

note top of XMLConfigBuilder
  parse() 只能执行一次。
  parseConfiguration() 按固定顺序处理
  properties -> settings -> environments -> mappers，
  其中 environmentsElement() 会装配 Environment。
end note

note bottom of EnvironmentBuilder
  XMLConfigBuilder.environmentsElement() 会先解析
  transactionManager 与 dataSource，
  再用 Environment.Builder 构造最终 Environment。
end note

note bottom of DefaultSqlSessionFactory
  DefaultSqlSessionFactory 是初始化产物。
  真正 openSession() 时才会读取 Environment，
  创建 Transaction 和 Executor。
end note

@enduml
